      checks.push({ level: "info", msg: "Uncertainty: the reference method is a bootstrap resampling patients, re-running trial construction and weighting inside each replicate (Keogh 2023). A robust variance clustered on patient is the cheaper alternative and was described by Danaei et al. (2013) as conservative. Model-based standard errors are wrong in either case." });
